  "prompt": "Compare these phone plans and recommend one for someone who uses about 12 GB a month and takes two one-week trips abroad a year. Basic: $25/month, 5 GB, extra data $10 per GB, no roaming. Plus: $40/month, 20 GB, roaming $5 per day. Max: $60/month, unlimited data, roaming included.",
